xmodel/block-descent-a1-quartic-cycle1-kummer-collision-hostile-review-gpt55-20260830.md:125:Reason: `pi|U` is etale along the relevant open, so the pullback of the reduced Cartier divisor `C0` is reduced at all points of `U` lying over it. The component `Phi` appears with multiplicity one because the normalization map `Phi -> C0` has generic degree one. The remaining components form a reduced residual effective divisor `E`. This confirms lines 154-162 of the inverse report.
