xmodel/max12-812-order2-square-d1-a8d3-moving-connection-rankjump-hostile-review-grok-v2-20260826.md:44:Family 15 of the frozen complete source inventory is `k6`, `A=2`, `C=0`, `R=0`, pole 3, coefficient `-3/32`, grade 38. Its independent source monomial `k60*a0*a1` has odd rows `(Phi5,Phi7)=(-3/16,+3p/64)`. There is no first-order `k6 A` negative family, so `q_A` has no negative part at this order and the inverse-root motion does not correct `k6A^2`. Faber conversion of the inventory's analytic family-15 monomials reproduces the literal rows, including the `p`-fill.
